              "main/p[1]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "以下文章的著作权等各种权利归原作者所有，翻译 By SeventhTG（XD）。如果你喜欢本文并有幸让你产生了转载的想法，请注明原作者、原文地址以及译者，谢谢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b3",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0003"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[2]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "原文地址：http://beginners.biz/reach/mamori14.html ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 立直的读牌1：  虽说是立直的读牌，并不是传说中读出对手听什么牌的高难度技术。 毫不夸张的说，读出立直者听什么这是不可能的。  "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b4",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0004"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[3]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b4",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0004"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[3]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例1的舍牌与假设A手牌。",
            "imageSha256": "f5f5b538f849ffaed26ffdf3ab8260988d1e31be62c29a46196b6d3ea4b0ff6c",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "93b6e63210fc9d684a0b61c311f6cfa216b39fcc3c9ca97386330cf784bb3a99"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "上排左侧标签：例1。牌序从左至右：3z 7z 1s 7m 3z 9m 1p 9p；第8张9p横置。\n下排左侧标签：假设A。手牌从左至右：2m 3m 3p 4p 5p 8p 8p 9p 7s 8s 1z 1z 1z。手牌右侧为“摸入”标签，标签右侧另有一张牌背朝外的牌。\n原图未显示的信息：假设A右侧“摸入”标签后的牌仅显示牌背，无法确定其牌面编码。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b5",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0005"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[4]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "比如例1的立直的手牌一向听的情况如图所示（假设）。 但是，我们是不能断定立直时所听的是什么牌。  摸到14万的话就听69索； 摸到69索的话就听14万。  听牌时的有效牌叫做“入目”， 正式因为有了入目，所以不能够做到一点读。  而且本来例1的手牌，除了现物之外，其他的牌危险程度都差不多。 随便给几个例子吧。图B~D的情况都是不能否定的。 "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b6",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0006"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[5]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b6",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0006"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[5]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "假设B、C、D的三组手牌。",
            "imageSha256": "f66217f6bd67534d7617d54b8b8b4f11e08de3a8e2ec556a20109f4451edf24b",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "1c362622f447f9ff1db1f0fee2f4851f552bb413e7f5821b1824010cbf8a3676"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "上排左侧标签：假设B。牌序从左至右：1m 2m 3m 3p 4p 5p 8p 8p 6s 7s 8s 9s 9s。\n中排左侧标签：假设C。牌序从左至右：3m 3m 4m 4m 5m 2p 3p 4p 6p 6p 7p 8p 9p。\n下排左侧标签：假设D。牌序从左至右：4m 4m 2p 4p 7p 8p 9p 4s 4s 5s 5s 6s 6s。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b7",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0007"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[6]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "结果就是，不要有“去判断立直者听什么”这种错误的想法。 “立直的听牌是不能读出的，也没有必要去读”，这个认识是立直读牌的第一步。  这样一来，我们读牌到底读什么呢？ 其实是“牌的危险度”和“牌的安全度”。  能够在攻守两方面灵活运用读牌，我觉得就是一位一流的雀士。 特别是寻找安全牌的技术是非常重要的，这对放铳率有着很深的影响。  理论、总结： 读出立直者听什么牌是不可能的，也没有这个必要。 对于有一定舍牌特征的立直，能够把握“危险的牌”和“相当安全的牌”才是真正的读牌。  下面，举几个“危险度比较高的牌”的例子。 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 五的里筋 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 有关里筋其他很多网站有许多记述，这里就不再详细说明了。 在实战中，里筋危险度比较高的就是“五的里筋”和“间四间” 过去常常说“早巡切5，就很可能是14或者69听牌。” 虽然还不知道统计的结果，不过这也是可以容易感觉到的东西。 "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b8",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0008"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[7]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b8",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0008"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[7]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例2的舍牌及三处向下箭头。",
            "imageSha256": "cb31e5367a24a3a2e1a23d541a897bfe09b22aca0636eaf8c92a9d1fe036dd18",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "2c7447cceb73ec5956fdde2f8a354c72cccd85d49173855b3ec0d2dc75fe6a00"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "左上方标签：例2。牌序从左至右：7z 9p 1z 5p 9m 8p 1s 7m 5s；第9张5s横置。\n三支向下箭头分别位于第3张1z、第6张8p、第7张1s的正上方。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b9",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0009"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[8]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例2的手牌，比较早得切出了5饼是一个特征。 9饼已经被切出了，所以14饼的危险度就比较高了。 实际的手牌如下： "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b10",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0010"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[9]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b10",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0010"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[9]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例2对应的实际手牌。",
            "imageSha256": "c0bbd1c4171eea4674f517b96ef4cbccd49a7479669f535f65f0522936cc5cad",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "607e79373012217eb1dfe99a24741363491f333f456ce06e0ec52574c25bd33f"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "单排手牌，从左至右：1m 1m 3m 4m 5m 2p 3p 2s 2s 3s 3s 4s 4s。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b11",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0011"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[10]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "当然听索子或者万子的可能性也是很高的， 但是14饼也要看做是危险的牌。  “早巡切了数牌5”这是非常重要的信息。 正是因为早巡切了利用价值很高的数牌5， 所以不难想象，他手牌里有23或者78的搭子。  即使是立直时切出数牌5， 我们也很难判断是以什么牌型切出来的。 是浮牌？还是57搭子摸到8之后才打出的？还是455切掉5来固定两面？ 总之有着很多的可能性。  例2立直时切出了5索， 但也不能说69索比其他无筋的牌要危险。  总结、理论： 面对早巡切出了数牌5的立直， 就应该警戒数牌5对应花色的14和69.  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 间四间（注：有关间四间，在福地诚与凸东北撰写的《科学麻将中》指出了其错误性，这里各位读者可以查阅资料了解。） ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  间四间读作“aidayonken”,有以下四种情况。  "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b12",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0012"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[11]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b12",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0012"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[11]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "间四间的四种条件与对应危险牌。",
            "imageSha256": "bb7f02f4157f636e0ad02cf92e9dc82136dc170af3380faf3b2473b02049d6b3",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "2e12d2a575793c871251f352a3baa22e94f553d4892b3c98a343ac5824a8dda1"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "| 条件1 | 条件2 | 危险牌 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 早巡切掉数牌3 | 舍牌中有数牌8 | 四七 |\n| 早巡切掉数牌4 | 舍牌中有数牌9 | 五八 |\n| 早巡切掉数牌6 | 舍牌中有数牌1 | 二五 |\n| 早巡切掉数牌7 | 舍牌中有数牌2 | 三六 |"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b13",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "两张相差5的数牌的里筋就叫做“间四间” “早巡切掉”是关键词， 利用度比较高的34和67在早巡被切出是间四间的一个条件。 "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b14",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1775262",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1775262:b0014"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[13]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1775262-b14",
